<title>USA: Cook County, Ill., bonds repriced, top yld raised.</title>
<headline>Cook County, Ill., bonds repriced, top yld raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Wednesday it repriced and restructured Cook County, Ill.'s $206 million general obligation bond issue, adding maturities in 2018 and 2019 and raising the top yield in 2022 to 5.82 percent from 5.80 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
